Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ installer-side data files
 Static data files needed by the Debian Installer ramdisk to run
 against a @DISTRIBUTION@ ISO: stub debconf templates that upstream
 udebs we don't ship would otherwise provide, release-identity
 files (/etc/lsb-release, /etc/default-release), and the
 debootstrap suite script for @CODENAME@.
 .
 Built from local source under fork/source/ and ships only static
 files — no compiled code.
